            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Pooja  Vaidya Gupta",
            "description": "<p>Leads <strong>Saajkari</strong>, the<strong> </strong>curated <strong>Marketplace by Cavirk</strong> with a clear conviction that the future of luxury lies in authenticity, cultural lineage, and craftsmanship. With a deep-rooted passion for fashion and heritage, she is reimagining how handcrafted products are discovered, valued, and experienced. </p><p>Under her leadership, Saajkari defines luxury through <strong>authenticity and provenance</strong>—championing products that carry a traceable story, uncompromised workmanship, and fair, transparent value. By working closely with creators and curators, she ensures that every piece on the platform reflects integrity, refinement, and a genuine connection to its origins.</p><p>Pooja's vision is to position Saajkari as the world’s most credible destination for handcrafted luxury: a platform that elevates artistry, builds trust with discerning consumers, and brings meaningful, story-rich products to a contemporary global audience.</p><p>Pooja’s leadership is driven by purpose—honouring craftsmanship, protecting heritage, and shaping a modern luxury ecosystem where every exceptional creation finds the recognition it deserves.<br/><br/></p>",
