            "description": "<p>Cavirk was founded by <strong>Debdeep Mukherjee </strong>and <strong>Bhanu Gupta </strong>with a vision to preserve and promote <strong>India’s rich heritage of handcrafted luxury</strong>. Initially established as a curated brand for artisanal products, Cavirk is now evolving into a<strong>premier marketplace for authentic, GI-registered handicrafts</strong>, offering a seamless platform for manufacturers, boutique owners and artisans to connect directly with discerning global customers.<br/><br/><strong>The name “Cavirk” reflects our ethos. </strong>With this transition into a <strong>marketplace in May 2025</strong>, Cavirk is set to become a trusted global destination, enabling customers to explore and acquire <strong>heritage-rich textiles and handcrafted masterpieces </strong>while empowering India’s most skilled artisans and craftspeople.</p>",
